error BYN1022: `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative

  4 │     unless ((a && a)) {
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a compound condition
    │
  help: use `if` with the negated condition
    │ 4 │     if !(a && a) {
    │   │     +++++++++++

error BYN1007: `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative

  7 │     unless ((!a)) {
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `unless` already negates
    │
  help: use `if` with the condition as written
    │ 7 │     if a {
    │   │     ++++

error BYN1007: `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative

  10 │     return unless (!a)
     │            ^^^^^^^^^^^ `unless` already negates
     │
  help: use `if` with the condition as written
     │ 10 │     return if a
     │    │            ++++

error BYN1022: `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative

  11 │     return unless ((a || a))
     │            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a compound condition
     │
  help: use `if` with the negated condition
     │ 11 │     return if !(a || a)
     │    │            +++++++++++

error BYN1023: `unless x is null` is not allowed; write `if x is not null`

  12 │     return unless (p is null)
     │            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a negated null test
     │
  help: use `if` with `is not null`
     │ 12 │     return if p is not null
     │    │            ++++++++++++++++
